OL,3,GNEWSAThe candidates hoping to be
OL,4,ALondon's second Tory mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We need to treat London seriously" -
OL,7,Fthe words of a leading Conservative MP
OL,8,Fas his party considers its next
OL,9,Fcandidate to be mayor of the capital.
OL,11,FThe party has just closed applications
OL,12,Ffor the role and there are four runners
OL,13,Fwho have openly declared.
OL,15,FIn 26 years, the Tories have only had
OL,16,Fone mayor in the capital, Boris
OL,17,FJohnson, who won two elections and
OL,18,Fserved from 2008 to 2016.
OL,20,FThe party has lost three elections
OL,21,Fsince then to Sadiq Khan, now Lord Khan
OL,22,Fof Tooting.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
